    "title": "MICROSERVICE-apiwizruntimedoc-List Pharmacy Prescriptions Historys-v3-spec",
    "description": "The Pharmacy Prescription History API provides access to a comprehensive list of prescriptions associated with a patient's history. This service allows healthcare providers and pharmacies to efficiently retrieve detailed records of past medications, ensuring better patient care and management. Typical use cases include verifying patient adherence to medications, reviewing historical prescriptions during consultations, and facilitating medication reconciliation. By utilizing this API, stakeholders can enhance coordination and safety in pharmaceutical care.",
